sequenceDiagram
    participant Log as Persistent incident history
    participant A as Agent A: investigate
    participant B as Agent B: act
    participant C as Agent C: verify
    activate A
    A->>Log: Read goal, constraints and prior evidence
    Log-->>A: Relevant recorded context
    A->>Log: Record findings and unfinished work
    deactivate A
    activate B
    B->>Log: Reconstruct context for the next task
    Log-->>B: Findings and current work state
    B->>Log: Record action result and verification needed
    deactivate B
    activate C
    C->>Log: Reconstruct context for verification
    Log-->>C: Action history and expected outcome
    C->>Log: Record verification and remaining issues
    deactivate C
